# Each MadScientist proposal clones into its own subdir here. The clones
# are throwaway working copies - their PR branches live in GitHub, not
# in the parent repo, so there's nothing useful to commit from this
# tree.
#
# Ignore everything except this .gitignore + .gitkeep so the host dir
# exists in the repo (so docker-compose's bind mount has a target) but
# the actual implementation worktrees aren't accidentally committed.

*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
